@startuml
title UC-PR-002 派发摄制任务 — 分析序列图
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
actor "摄制部部长" as A
boundary "接口:部长接口" as B
control "控制:派发摄制任务控制" as C
participant "M:成员" as M
participant "P:摄制预约" as P
participant "N:成员" as N
A -> B: 派发摄制任务(业务信息)
activate B
B -> C: 派发摄制任务(业务信息)
activate C
C -> M: 验证业务资格(操作人、部门与职责)
M --> C: 资格结论
break 无权执行
  C --> B: 拒绝结果及原因
  B --> A: 拒绝结果及原因
end

C -> P: 确定承接(部长、指定成员、派发)
activate P
P -> N: 验证归属(摄制部)
N --> P: 成员资格
alt 无承接人且资格有效
  P --> C: 唯一承接结果
else 已被派发、抢单或资格无效
  P --> C: 拒绝，保留已有承接关系
end
deactivate P

C --> B: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate C
B --> A: 业务结果或拒绝原因
deactivate B
@enduml
